-- Migration 40: Credential.local_path for local model files.
--
-- Why
--
-- Local models (Ollama GGUFs via llama-server, Whisper .bin, Piper/Kokoro
-- .onnx) are referenced by absolute filesystem path, never containerized.
-- Each Credential row can now store the model's local path so it survives
-- across logins and devices without hardcoding anything in .env.
-- PC and phone have different paths for the same logical model, so the
-- path is per-Credential (per-device), not per-Model.

DEFINE FIELD IF NOT EXISTS local_path ON credential TYPE option<string>;
